<P><FONT size=4>全体教工：</FONT></P>
<P><FONT size=4>    根据绍兴市教育局相关文件要求，现转发市局《绍兴市师德考核负面清单（征求意见稿）》《绍兴市师德失范行为处理办法（征求意见稿）》，并面向全体在校一线教职工征求对上述两个文件的意见和建议。请大家认真阅读文件征求意见稿内容，积极建言。如有相关意见和建议，请大家于10月7日下午2:00前书面文字提交至党政办。谢谢大家！</FONT></P>
<P><FONT size=4>                                                                                     党政办</FONT></P>
<P><FONT size=4>                                                                                       10月6日</FONT></P>
<P>附：</P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 15.65pt 0pt 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; mso-para-margin-top: 1.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; mso-pagination: none" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=黑体>绍兴市师德考核负面清单</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">(征求意见稿)</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋"><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">为贯彻落实《中共中央 国务院关于全面深化新时代教师队伍建设改革的意见》</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">和教育部印发的</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">新时代教师职业行为十项准则</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">及</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">违反职业道德行为处理办法等文件精神，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">结合我市实际</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">，制定</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">以下教师</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">师德考核负面清单。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">一、在</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">教育教学活动中</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">及其他场合有损害党中央权威、违背党的路线方针政策的言行。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">二、传播、散布损害国家主权、安全和社会公共利益的言论，传播邪教和宣传封建迷信，编造散布虚假信息、不良信息，参与黄赌毒活动。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">三、在教育教学活动中遇突发事件时不履行保护学生人身安全职责。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">四、体罚或以侮辱、歧视等方式变相体罚学生，并造成身心伤害；或</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">与学生发生不正当关系，有任何形式的猥亵、性骚扰行为。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">五、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">组织</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">或</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">参与有偿补课，到校外培训机构</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">兼课</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">兼职</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">为校外培训机构和他人介绍生源、提供相关信息</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">六、组织或参与针对学生的营利性活动，向学生推销教辅资料、报刊、保险或利用家长资源谋取私利。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">七、索要或收受学生、家长的礼金礼品，参加学生、家长付费的宴请、旅游、娱乐休闲等活动。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
