<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1" align=justify><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">第三条<SPAN> </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">对师德失范、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">出现负面清单行为的教师，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">学校及主管部门应当及时组织调查核实，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">根据情节轻重，给予相应处理或处分。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-add-space: auto" align=justify><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">（一）情节较轻的，给予</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">相应的处理，包括</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">批评教育、诫勉谈话、责令检查、通报批评，调离教学岗位，以及取消在评</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">先</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">评优、职务晋升、职称评</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">聘</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">、岗位聘用、工资晋级等方面的资格。以上取消相关资格的处理执行期限不得少于24个月。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-add-space: auto" align=justify><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">（二）情节严重的，在按照本</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">条第</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">一</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">项</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">处理基础上，应根据《事业单位工作人员处分暂行规定》给予行政处分，包括警告、记过、降低岗位等级或撤职、开除</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">警告期限为6个月，记过期限为12个月，降低岗位等级或撤职期限为24个月。给予行政重处分的中共党员，应同时给予相应的党纪处分。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-add-space: auto" align=justify><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">（</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">三</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">）涉嫌犯罪的，及时移送</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">有关部门</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">依法处理。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=justify><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">第四条 教师</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">受到行政处分或党纪处分的，受处分期内暂缓教师资格定期注册。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">根据</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">《教师资格条例》</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">有关</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">规定</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">应</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">撤销教师资格的，撤销其教师资格。需要解除聘用合同的，按照《事业单位人事管理条例》等相关规定进行处理。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=justify><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">第五条</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">对师德失范</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">的教师</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">作出处理或处分决定前，应当听取教师的陈述和申辩，必要时可听取学生、其他教师、家长委员会或者家长代表意见。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=justify><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">第六条 给予教师处理，应当坚持公平公正、教育与惩处相结合的原则，应当事实清楚、证据确凿、定性准确、处理恰当、程序合法、手续完备。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=justify><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">第七条 处理或处分决定应当书面通知教师本人并载明认定的事实、理由、依据、期限及申诉途径等内容。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=justify><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">第八条</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">对于受到取消相关资格处理的教师，在执行期限内能主动纠正违规行为，执行期满且经处理部门考</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">察</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">认定后，可</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">按相关规定申请</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">恢复被取消的相关资格。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=justify><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">第九条</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体"> 处理或处分</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">期满后，根据悔改表现予以延期或解除。处理或处分决定和解除决定都应完整存入个人人事档案及教师管理信息系统。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><FONT face=Calibri>第十条 本办法自发布之日起施行。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P></P>
    
